{"name":"Ruby Slippers","hex":"#9c2e33","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"ruby slippers","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A valuable feature (of software, etc.) overlooked by the user."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/ruby_slippers"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ruby slippers","blocks":[{"text":"The ruby slippers are a pair of magical shoes worn by Dorothy Gale as played by Judy Garland in the 1939 Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer musical film The Wizard of Oz. Because of their iconic stature, they are as of December 2024 the most valuable items of film memorabilia in the world. Several pairs were made for the film, though the exact number is unknown. Five pairs are known to have survived; one pair was stolen from a museum in 2005 and recovered in 2018."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Ruby_slippers.JPG/330px-Ruby_slippers.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruby_slippers","wikidata":"Q843007"},{"title":"Ruby Slippers (Once Upon a Time)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Ruby Slippers\" is the eighteenth episode of the fifth season of the American fantasy drama series Once Upon a Time, which aired on April 17, 2016."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f7/Ruby_Slippers_%28Once_Upon_A_Time%29.jpg/330px-Ruby_Slippers_%28Once_Upon_A_Time%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruby_Slippers_(Once_Upon_a_Time)","wikidata":"Q25217899"},{"title":"Ruby","blocks":[{"text":"Ruby is a pinkish-red to blood-red-colored gemstone, a variety of the mineral corundum, consisting of aluminium oxide (α-Al2O3). Ruby is one of the most popular traditional jewelry gems and is very durable. Other varieties of gem-quality corundum are called sapphires, and rubies are also sometimes referred to as \"red sapphires\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Corundum-215330.jpg/330px-Corundum-215330.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ruby","wikidata":"Q43088"},{"title":"Slipper","blocks":[{"text":"Slippers are a type of shoes falling under the broader category of light footwear, that are easy to put on and off and are intended to be worn indoors, particularly at home. They provide comfort and protection for the feet when walking indoors."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Slippers.jpg/330px-Slippers.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slipper","wikidata":"Q876824"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Arabic_ruby_slippers.jpg/500px-Arabic_ruby_slippers.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Arabic_ruby_slippers.jpg/500px-Arabic_ruby_slippers.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The \"Arabian\" ruby slippers on display at the auction of the collection of Debbie Reynolds in Beverly Hills on June 18, 2011","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AArabic_ruby_slippers.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Dorothy%27s_Ruby_Slippers%2C_Wizard_of_Oz_1938.jpg/500px-Dorothy%27s_Ruby_Slippers%2C_Wizard_of_Oz_1938.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Dorothy%27s_Ruby_Slippers%2C_Wizard_of_Oz_1938.jpg/1280px-Dorothy%27s_Ruby_Slippers%2C_Wizard_of_Oz_1938.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Dorothy%27s_Ruby_Slippers%2C_Wizard_of_Oz_1938.jpg/500px-Dorothy%27s_Ruby_Slippers%2C_Wizard_of_Oz_1938.jpg?utm_source=en.